v 3
d fastata: fast official Stata data commands (Rust plugin)
d
d fastata makes egen, isid, duplicates, xtile, pctile, destring and tostring fast without
d changing their syntax, results or messages. After fastata enable, Stata runs fastata's versions
d of these commands whenever they are called, also from other ado-files; any input fastata has not
d verified runs the original command. fastata disable undoes it. The computation is a compiled
d Rust plugin (Linux, macOS, Windows).
d
d Author: Leo Liu, auleo.liu@gmail.com
d License: MIT
d Distribution-Date: 20261017
